e could be on a network or scheduler thread which we must not block\n+        try {\n+            return future.result();\n+        } catch (ExecutionException e) {\n+            throw new UncategorizedExecutionException(\"An error occurred fetching timestamp field type for \" + index, e);\n+        }","submitted_line":182},"generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The change in `result()` method now throws an `ExecutionException` directly without wrapping checked exceptions in an `UncategorizedExecutionException`. This simplifies the exception handling but may break existing code that expects a specific type of exception (e.g., `UncategorizedExecutionException`). Ensure that all calling sites are updated to handle `ExecutionException` appropriately. Decide on a consistent approach for exception handling across the codebase.","nodes":[{"id":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/common/util/CancellableSingleObjectCacheTests.java-server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/common/util/CancellableSingleObjectCacheTests.java-8469:8481-7492:7498,7499:7517,8116:8140,8234:8258,8703:8709","promptId":"#Q4GVC","srcPath":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/common/util/CancellableSingleObjectCacheTests.java","dstPath":"server/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/common/util/CancellableSingleObjectCacheTests.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":8469,"endPos":8481,"startLine":190,"startLineOffset":27,"endLine":190,"endLineOffset":39,"length":13}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":7492,"endPos":7498,"startLine":170,"startLineOffset":64,"endLine":170,"endLineOffset":70,"length":7},{"pos":7499,"endPos":7517,"startLine":170,"startLineOffset":71,"endLine":170,"endLineOffset":89,"length":19},{"pos":8116,"endPos":8140,"startLine":181,"startLineOffset":43,"endLine":181,"endLineOffset":67,"length":25},{"pos":8234,"endPos":8258,"startLine":182,"startLineOffset":43,"endLine":182,"endLineOffset":67,"length":25},{"pos":8703,"endPos":8709,"startLine":190,"startLineOffset":27,"endLine":190,"endLineOffset":33,"length":7}]},{"